    [Misc][CI] main2main 1010  a98247a (#18224)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Bump the verified vLLM main pin from `c4df37df` to `a98247ab` and adapt
    vllm-ascend to the upstream changes in that range. The v0.31.0 release
    lane is kept intact: each adaptation is gated on
    `vllm_version_is("0.31.0")` (or a version-aware helper) so both the
    `main` and the `v0.31.0` CPU UT lanes stay green.
    
    The range contains a large breaking KV-cache/attention rework plus a set
    of smaller API changes:
    
    - vllm#57169 reworked the KV cache layout: it dropped the MLA
    `storage_block_size` override, added a leading `vllm_config` to
    `_pool_bytes_per_block`, removed
    `kernel_block_sizes`/`blocks_per_kv_block` from `BlockTables`, split
    metadata-builder creation out of `initialize_attn_backend` and made
    `AttentionGroup` identity-comparable.
    - vllm#60335 renamed the spec-decode AR path (`autoregressive` ->
    `target_dependent_ar`) and added `num_speculative_steps`/
    `num_speculative_tokens` to `propose()` and the decode callbacks.
    - vllm#60517 removed the torch.compile sequence-parallelism/AsyncTP
    passes `PassConfig.enable_sp`/`fuse_gemm_comms`/`sp_min_token_num`,
    `update_sizes_for_sequence_parallelism` and the `tensor_parallel_size`
    argument of the cudagraph-size resolvers.
    - vllm#60754 renamed the DP-sync state (`dp_sync` -> `dp_sync_state`)
    and added `ExecuteModelState.num_spec_tokens_to_schedule`.
    - vllm#58411 added `randomize_inputs` to `profile_run`/`_dummy_run`.
    - vllm#60271 added a hard batch-invariance support check for every
    attention backend.
    - vllm#59327 moved the DeepSeek-V4.1 Engram module to `common.engram`.
    - vllm#57387 moved the GLM-5-Next config classes into `transformers`
    (hence the `transformers` 5.14.1 -> 5.19.0 bump, which main requires
    anyway).
    - Smaller seams: vllm#59175 added `prefill_end` to KV allocation,
    vllm#53175 forwards the layer's spec to
    `get_supported_kernel_block_sizes`, vllm#58067 passes `separators` to
    xgrammar, vllm#53934 made `CudaGraphManager.dp_size` a property,
    vllm#56723 builds draft metadata through the attention group, vllm#57934
    makes MRV1 reject DFlash candidate-head drafts.
    
